{
  "meta": {
    "name": "todo_kinds",
    "version": "1.0.5",
    "description": "The kinds of to-do (review reason) a processing step can raise (177, plan 170 E6, jav/core/todo_kinds.py). A to-do's kind is the first two parts of its reason (`<prefix>:<name>`, as the interface's label reads it); `<prefix>:*` stands for a family whose second part varies (each validator check, each JEV error), `*:<name>` for one whose first part is a field. shape: the whole reason; owners: the modules that raise it (none: only earlier runs have it); example: one reason of the kind, for the label test (ui/src/todoKinds177.test.ts). The owner's decision of 2026-10-19 (177): only the tests and the before/after replay watch that a step raises registered kinds; the store accepts any reason, as before.",
    "changelog": [
      {
        "version": "1.0.5",
        "date": "2026-10-23",
        "note": "208 (plan G-process-core R2): the shared core's modules moved into jav/core/; the paths here follow them, nothing else changed."
      },
      {
        "version": "1.0.4",
        "date": "2026-10-23",
        "note": "208 (plan G-process-core R2): the finance domain's modules moved into jav/domains/finance/; the paths here follow them, nothing else changed."
      },
      {
        "version": "1.0.3",
        "date": "2026-10-23",
        "note": "208 (plan G-process-core R2): the email domain's modules moved into jav/domains/email/; the paths here follow them, nothing else changed."
      },
      {
        "version": "1.0.2",
        "date": "2026-10-21",
        "note": "190 (plan 189 A2b, A2d): `text:empty`, a document given as text (an email's own text) that has no text at all; `jev:missing_rows` and `jev:extra_rows`, the per-list questions a verification call site may name; `follow_up:*`, an item's follow-up stage that ended without its own to-do but not cleanly (A2f)."
      },
      {
        "version": "1.0.1",
        "date": "2026-10-19",
        "note": "177: `*:not_in_enum` (a field's value is not one its type pack allows, jav/models.py), found by the tests' check."
      },
      {
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "date": "2026-10-19",
        "note": "177 (plan 170 E6): first version, from the code's producers and the stored to-dos."
      }
    ]
  },
